# Pairs with GateOwnership. The capture's Wait(0) on the gate is what stops it splitting under a foreground split.
MODULE: CaptureSkipsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture turn splits without trying the split gate
PERTURBS: BeginCapture

--- FIND
    /\ Admits(l, FALSE)
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "split"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ Admits(l, FALSE)
    \* MUTATION: the gate is not tried
    /\ cap' = [cap EXCEPT ![l] = "splitting"]
--- END
